{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>May YHWH lift His face toward you.</b> For eternal life, as in כִּי עִמְּךָ מְקוֹר חַיִּים (Psalms 36:10), and as they said (Berakhot 17a): צַדִּיקִים יוֹשְׁבִים וְעַטְרוֹתֵיהֶם בְּרָאשֵׁיהֶם וּמִתְעַנְּגִים מִזִּיו שְׁכִינָה — \"the righteous sit with their crowns on their heads and delight in the radiance of the Shekhinah.\"" "<b>And grant you peace.</b> The rest of peace — that is, eternity without any admixture of punishment — which befits every person who is whole for eternal life."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:53.272395525Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}